OL,3,GNEWSAInter-island matches costing
OL,4,Asports clubs up to #10k
OL,5,
OL,6,FSport representatives in the Channel
OL,7,FIslands say inter-island fixtures are
OL,8,Funder threat due to the cost and
OL,9,Finfrequency of travel between the
OL,10,Fislands.
OL,12,FA proposed summer ferry service between
OL,13,FJersey and Guernsey was withdrawn by
OL,14,Fthe operator after being rejected by
OL,15,FGuernsey's Committee for Economic
OL,16,FDevelopment.
OL,18,FJersey's football team has been quoted
OL,19,Fa cost of #10,000 to play the Muratti
OL,20,Fsemi-final in Alderney next March.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
