OL,3,GNEWSAInter-island matches costing
OL,4,Asports clubs up to #10k
OL,5,
OL,6,FGuernsey Football Association chief
OL,7,Fexecutive Gary Roberts said: "For all
OL,8,Fthese grassroots clubs and sports,
OL,9,Fthose are significant costs, so
OL,10,Fanything the governments can do to help
OL,11,Fwith timetables and costs and support
OL,12,Ffor sport would be greatly
OL,13,Fappreciated."
